1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,484
Veil brings private receiving to NEAR names.

2
00:00:03,484 --> 00:00:09,047
This tour shows the current app and verified transactions from November eleventh.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,629
Start with a testnet wallet.

4
00:00:12,629 --> 00:00:16,327
Derive keys asks for a signed message.

5
00:00:16,327 --> 00:00:21,160
Veil keeps the resulting viewing and spending keys in your browser.

6
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,969
Register name publishes two public keys.

7
00:00:26,969 --> 00:00:31,703
Here, Resolve reads Alice's existing registration directly from testnet.

8
00:00:31,703 --> 00:00:34,886
Her private keys are not part of that record.

9
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:39,133
Enter a registered name and an amount.

10
00:00:39,133 --> 00:00:43,257
A signed payment goes to a fresh implicit account.

11
00:00:43,257 --> 00:00:48,645
These three recorded sends each used a different sender and destination.

12
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:58,887
In the verified testnet run, Alice's viewing key found all three incoming payments.

13
00:00:58,887 --> 00:01:02,531
View tags help filter unrelated announcements.

14
00:01:02,531 --> 00:01:05,772
Each matching payment lives in its own account.

15
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:12,193
The recorded spend proves that a one-time account can send funds.

16
00:01:12,193 --> 00:01:18,686
The app warns before spending to your named account, because that creates a public link.

17
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:26,212
Copy view key shares read-only access with an accountant.

18
00:01:26,212 --> 00:01:30,148
The auditor enters the registered name and viewing key here.

19
00:01:30,148 --> 00:01:34,436
They can find incoming payments, but cannot spend them.

20
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:41,798
The recorded Sputnik DAO payout was approved by its sole council member.

21
00:01:41,798 --> 00:01:46,286
The recipient scanner found the payment at a fresh account.

22
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:48,674
Veil is testnet-only.

23
00:01:48,674 --> 00:01:51,616
Amounts, timing and senders remain public.

24
00:01:51,616 --> 00:01:54,001
Combining balances reveals links.

25
00:01:54,001 --> 00:01:56,324
Try the app at the address on screen.
